cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this code or its results in published work, please cite the
  relevant version below AND the underlying physics references listed at
  the bottom. See docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for the full list of observational
  data sources used and how to cite them. v0.3-prelim-D15-CORRECTED3 and
  Mediator_Detection_v12 are the most recent closed rounds at the time of
  initial publication (2026-08-14).
title: "sidm-composite-dm-mediator"
type: software
version: 0.3-prelim-D15-CORRECTED3
date-released: 2026-08-13
authors:
